WEBVTT

00:00:28.716 --> 00:00:30.396
but like hoop skirts and top hats,

00:00:30.436 --> 00:00:33.076
cousin marriage used to be
a much more common sight.

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:37.476
People like Charles Darwin,
Edgar Allan Poe and Albert Einstein,

00:00:37.516 --> 00:00:39.396
all married their first cousins.

00:00:39.396 --> 00:00:41.516
President Franklin Delano Roosevelt

00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:43.996
married his fifth cousin,
Eleanor Roosevelt.

00:00:43.996 --> 00:00:46.156
She didn't even have
to change her last name.

00:00:46.156 --> 00:00:48.956
One study looking at millions
of genealogy profiles

00:00:48.996 --> 00:00:52.436
concluded that between 1650 and 1850,

00:00:52.476 --> 00:00:55.116
the average person was fourth cousins
with their spouse.

00:00:55.156 --> 00:00:57.476
I know, I know, what the hell
is a fourth cousin?

00:00:57.516 --> 00:00:59.756
Well, it basically means
that the average person

00:00:59.796 --> 00:01:03.996
had the same great great great grandparent
as their romantic partner.